        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Ot 22:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmwochï Daudi tuyot kïmïkul lö, “Werïnyan Solomon nyo kakïl Tororöt, wölo tökïmïnïng akïtomönye kunkïtï cho chang. Wow ighisyonï nyoman, ompöwölo melö pö tekate chi, wölo Kö pö ECHOTYON Tororöt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonoghyan nyoman ayar tïkuchï kïtektoy: Koltin nko silpa nko taghoy nko karïn nko ket nko koghïn cho pïchighöch nko koghïn cho walaka cho sisinchö nko koghïn walaka cho karamach nko senkwet cho chang. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompö paraku choni konyorwan, kotötan silpa nko koltin cho le chichan kegh ompöwölo ochöman Kö pö Tororöt.* ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotötan tïkwïl tanin cho tïlöy 100 cho pö koltin cho pïchighöch nko tanin cho ngata 240 cho pö silpa cho karamach cho kïsïlo nöyetwo Kö pö Tororöt ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nko tïkwïn walaka löwïr cho igho puntinö morikwa. Ngo ye nyu chi anka nyo mököy kïropchini kïgh ECHOTYON ompö machatenyi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutöto nyu ompö chamatengwa kintöghoghi korïn nko yetïntino ortïn nko kintöghoghi pipö lïk nko kirwokoti ka pöytoghin ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tïkuchï atöketeka Kö pö Tororöt: Tanin cho tïlöy 170 cho pö koltin nko tanin cho tïlöy 340 cho pö silpa nko tanin cho ngata 620 cho pö taghoy nko tanin cho tïlöy 3,400 cho pö karïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitötö pich koghïn cho pïchighöch cho kitïng kutö Kö pö Tororöt, akï Yeiel nyo pö ara Kersyon nyo kiripöy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingörechote pich ompöwölo kitötö chane ompö machatengwa, kingörekyö ompöwölo kikitötö tïkwïn cho tenö choni. Kingarak pöytoghintö Daudi tya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kisal Daudi Tororöt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsal Daudi Tororöt ompö tawu tuyonini kïmïkul, kïlentöy, “Nya kïsala kaynengu kokay, we ECHOTYON, Tororöt pö paponcha Israel! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.6.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 6:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ichinyi wow aitïngönyi owesyö nko ororyö nko rïntagh nko kimuytaghat. Tïkwïn cho mi yïm nko ngwïny kï cheku aichinyi pöytoghin iminyi paraku tïkwïn löwïr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngwïno wölo imitenyi monkornan nko konyït, ipöytonyi tïkwïn löwïr ompö owesyengu aimukenyi ighenyi chi kïyetï akwawesit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyokuchanyi sörö ye Tororötïnyo akekwolecha kaynengu nyo oror.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Momukanye nko piköchan ntokoninyi kïgh, ompöwölo ropöwon kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo ngwïno wölo iminyi. Kökïkonichanyi pat tïkwïn cho köle cheku tagh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlatecha to nko pïnot ompö tawungu le wölo kilata papotïnecha. Körökegh osiswecha nko rurwö nyo weröy, amökimukechanye ntökechïwïta meghat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakipuchanyi tïkuchï löwïr ECHOTYON Tororötïnyo, atö keteka kongu nyo kïkonyïto kaynengu nyo Tïlil, wölo kapkana wölo imitenyi akï cheku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onkïtön lö ityömenyi mïkulis, aichömenyi pich cho tïng konyït. Kokonwan chete ompö konyït nko ompö chamatenyan kegh, akasïwan piköku chï kötuyechï yi lö kepunyi ropöw ompö ngörekyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ECHOTYON Tororöt pö papotïnecha Apraam nko Isak nko Yakopo, itö ngalechete mïkulis pö piköku kokay aikany kïpöru chane wölo imitenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tönö werïnyan Solomon mïkulögh nyo karam atökwigh kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo imwochinenyi akïrïp wölo kïtektoy.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïmwochï Daudi pich lö, “Okwolö ECHOTYON Tororötïngwo!” Kïkwol tuyonay kïmïkul ECHOTYON Tororöt pö kukötinekwa akïkïtïngchï ECHOTYON ompö konyït nko ompö pöytoghin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutö chane ECHOTYON asisto odeny amörostin cho kïpelöy: Eghin 1,000 nko mökol 1,000 nko wara kechir cho le 1,000 cho kikïpel löwïr ompö atay kïpelo Amöros. Kipï tïkwïl ropöwo dipay.* ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingörekyö chane asisoni akwomisïyi: akïgheghsïyi ompö tawu ECHOTYON.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyo pö odeny kïkïl Solomon kïlïkwï pöytoghin. Kuyil nyinte ompö kaynata ECHOTYON kïlïkwï pöytoghintengwa, kïlïkwï Sadok tïsinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Pöy 2:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kïcheng Solomon ngacharuto paponyi Daudi nyo kitor ECHOTYON. Ki pöytoghin nyinte nyo karam, kitek nyinte pipö Israel löwïr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
